<main>
  <h1>Our halls</h1>
  <p>The museum has three permanent halls. Each one takes about forty minutes to see.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="ice-age">Ice Age</a>: mammoths, woolly rhinos and cave lions.</li>
    <li><a href="rivers?utm_campaign=autumn">Volga Rivers</a>: fish, birds and the river delta.</li>
    <li><a href="minerals">Minerals</a>: crystals from the Ural Mountains.</li>
  </ul>
  <img src="img/halls-map.png" alt="Map of the halls">
  <p>Bookmarked our old page? The <a href="/old/halls/rivers">old rivers page</a> still works. You can also jump to the <a href="rivers#map">rivers hall map</a>.</p>
